  "description": "Runtime representation of Logical Devices / Logical Nodes / Data Objects / Data Attributes, built from IEC 61850-7-3 Common Data Classes and 61850-7-4 Logical Node classes. Every definition carries an independent per-part revision tag (61850-6, 7-1, 7-2, 7-3, 7-4, 8-1 do not advance together) plus protocol/service feature flags (e.g. enhanced security control, tracking services, AdditionalCause) -- not data-model tags alone.",
